OL,3,GNEWSADoctors say radical plan to merge
OL,4,AScotland's health boards should be
OL,5,Ascrapped
OL,6,
OL,7,FLeading doctors are calling on the
OL,8,FScottish government to withdraw its
OL,9,Fplans to drastically reduce the number
OL,10,Fof health boards.
OL,12,FThe new chairwoman of BMA Scotland, Dr
OL,13,FNora Murray-Cavanagh, said the proposal
OL,14,Fto cut the number from 14 to just two
OL,15,Fwould be costly and time consuming -
OL,16,Fand that there was no clear evidence it
OL,17,Fwould benefit patients.
OL,19,FFirst Minister John Swinney unveiled
OL,20,Fthe plan a month ago, saying it would
OL,21,Fstreamline management and free up
OL,22,Fresources for frontline care.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
