OL,3,GNEWSADoctors say radical plan to merge
OL,4,AScotland's health boards should be
OL,5,Ascrapped
OL,6,
OL,7,FHealth Secretary Angela Constance said
OL,8,Fshe stood by the proposals and promised
OL,9,Fengagement with a range of groups
OL,10,Fincluding unions and NHS boards as the
OL,11,Fdetails were developed.
